{"screen_name": "naaaaaaco369", "file": "naaaaaaco369-4cc40e", "name": "naco", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020013190600617985/QoOyvZc_.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1398648748935237634/1724388259/1500x500", "description": "Love to draw ┋ EN日本語OK ┋ 💚https://vgen.co/naaaaaaco369 🩵https://skeb.jp/@naaaaaaco369", "total_works": 34, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-18T04:13:47.508650+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-18T04:13:47.508650+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T04:13:47.508650+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/naaaaaaco369", "name": "naaaaaaco369"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@naaaaaaco369", "name": "naaaaaaco369"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://vgen.co/naaaaaaco369", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@naaaaaaco369/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5821073/uploads/origins/6edf1c15-afb1-4c8b-8bd9-9a9c2570ba95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3bdb0ac8483f88e97b7c125c3d29609", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c5821073/uploads/origins/6edf1c15-afb1-4c8b-8bd9-9a9c2570ba95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3bdb0ac8483f88e97b7c125c3d29609, https://si.imgix.net/c5821073/uploads/origins/6edf1c15-afb1-4c8b-8bd9-9a9c2570ba95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a39eded0ada7bc58af51c2d8236158e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c5821073/uploads/origins/6edf1c15-afb1-4c8b-8bd9-9a9c2570ba95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c84448cf964d3b8ce8e7613fe327c76b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Vtuberのまさるドット子と申します！以前描いていただいたイラスト、とっても大好きです！\n今回は新衣装の依頼をさせていただきたくリクエストを送らせていただきました！\n\n【用途】\nYoutube(収益化済み)と